{"id":"72c0bba1-e6c3-447c-8f92-155d8c827993","slug":"hudson-mcdaniel-or-compact-elite-dashboard","fullDescription":"Expand the athlete profile with new sections below the hero: (1) Add No-Gi / All / Gi toggle buttons above the competition log to filter match history by format. (2) Restructure the layout into a 2-column grid: LEFT (2/3 width) shows the filtered Competition Log table with match history. RIGHT (1/3 width) shows two new cards: 'Upcoming Tournaments' (list of next events Hudson is registered for) and 'Rival Fighters' (top competitors/matchups to watch). (3) Add an 'Advanced Analytics' section with detailed performance breakdowns (submission types, win/loss by position, etc.). Keep the dark luxury editorial aesthetic consistent. Reference the design at https://jitz-gg-1.onrender.com/fighter/hudson-mcdaniel-8408 for layout inspiration.","prompt":"Expand the athlete profile with new sections below the hero: (1) Add No-Gi / All / Gi toggle buttons above the competition log to filter match history by format. (2) Restructure the layout into a 2-column grid: LEFT (2/3 width) shows the filtered Competition Log table with match history. RIGHT (1/3 width) shows two new cards: 'Upcoming Tournaments' (list of next events Hudson is registered for) and 'Rival Fighters' (top competitors/matchups to watch). (3) Add an 'Advanced Analytics' section with detailed performance breakdowns (submission types, win/loss by position, etc.). Keep the dark luxury editorial aesthetic consistent. Reference the design at https://jitz-gg-1.onrender.com/fighter/hudson-mcdaniel-8408 for layout inspiration.\n\nHere is a reference implementation:\n\n~~~html\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Hudson McDaniel | JITS.GG Profile</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconi